@page "/projects/{ProjectId:int}/overview"
@layout AppLayout
@attribute [Authorize(Roles = Roles.Admin + "," + Roles.Staff + "," + Roles.Mentor)]
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.Components
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.Pages.Mentor
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.Services
@using AuthWithAdmin.Shared.AuthSharedModels
@using System.Net.Http.Json
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@inject IProjectOverviewService ProjectOverview
@inject IRoadmapStagesService RoadmapService
@inject IPendingMentorApprovalsService Approvals
@inject ITaskSubmissionsService SubmissionsService
@inject HttpClient Http

@*
    ── מרחב הפרויקט (Lecturer) ──────────────────────────────────────────────

    THE SAME WORKSPACE THE MENTOR SEES, WITH A LECTURER'S CONTENT. Everything
    below the two role-specific controls is <ProjectWorkspace/>: one
    composition, one stylesheet, one set of row shapes. This file's only job is
    to turn the endpoints a lecturer is authorised for into a
    ProjectWorkspaceView.

    WHAT CHANGED FROM THE PAGE THIS REPLACES, and why:

      · THE SIX KPI CARDS ARE GONE. התקדמות כללית / אבני דרך / משימות / הגשות
        חסרות / בקשות פתוחות / משימות באיחור each restated a section directly
        beneath it. Every one of those numbers still exists — as a tab badge,
        as the attention count, as the משימות tab's own note, or as the row it
        was always counting — but attached to something you can open.

      · PROGRESS IS MILESTONE-BASED. The page used to lead with task
        completion, while the mentor's led with milestone completion, so the
        same project read 62% on one screen and 40% on the other. Milestones
        are the headline on both now; task completion stayed, as the משימות
        tab's secondary line.

      · THE THREE TABLES BECAME THREE SECTIONS. A flat task table, a request
        table and a submissions table were three scrollable grids asking the
        reader to re-orient three times; they then became three TABS, which
        asked the reader to visit each in turn and remember the other two.
        Same rows, same facts, three cards — all of them on the page at once,
        each stating its own count and each as tall as its content.

      · A REQUEST AND A SUBMISSION OPEN A REAL DETAIL SURFACE. A request used
        to grow inside the list; a submission sent the lecturer away to
        /lecturer/submissions to read it. Both open PwDetail over this page
        now — the same shell, the same hierarchy and the same file/history
        vocabulary the mentor's review uses — with the same endpoints and the
        same authorization behind them.

      · NOTHING WAS DROPPED. Moodle status (read for all, editable for
        Admin/Staff), add-mentor, mentor names, project type, the milestone
        titles, the requesters, the reviewer feedback and the missing-submission
        rule are all still here; see the builders below for where each landed.

      · THERE IS NO מועדים קרובים CARD. It listed every future milestone and
        deliverable date on the project — and every one of those dates was
        already on the page: a milestone's on the journey strip, a
        deliverable's now on its own row in הגשות (see SubmissionRows), a
        task's on its row in משימות. A card whose entire content is a second
        copy of dates shown elsewhere is not a section, it is a duplicate.

    WHAT A LECTURER STILL CANNOT DO HERE, on purpose: schedule a guidance
    meeting. A personal task's project association is granted through
    ProjectMentors only (ProjectsController.GetPersonalTasks), so this role
    gets no scheduler — rather than a button that would 403.
*@

<div class="lpw-page" dir="rtl">

    <a class="lpw-back" href="/projects">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
             stroke-width="2.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
        </svg>
        הצוותים שלי
    </a>

    @if (_loading)
    {
        <MLoadingState Label="טוענת את מרחב הפרויקט…" />
    }
    else if (_data is null)
    {
        <MEmptyState Live="true"
                     Title="הפרויקט לא נמצא או אינו פעיל"
                     Description="ייתכן שהפרויקט הועבר לארכיון, טרם שויך לצוות, או שאין לך הרשאה אליו.">
            <Action>
                <MButton Variant="MButton.ButtonVariant.Secondary"
                         OnClick="@(() => Nav.NavigateTo("/projects"))">
                    חזרה לצוותים שלי
                </MButton>
            </Action>
        </MEmptyState>
    }
    else
    {
        @* CONTEXT IS THE ROUTE, not the role list. This file is only ever
           reached through /projects/{id}/overview, so it declares Lecturer
           unconditionally — a dual-role account (Staff + Mentor) that arrives
           here from הצוותים שלי gets the lecturer's workspace even though
           RoleService.IsMentor would also answer true for them. *@
        <ProjectWorkspace View="@View"
                          Context="PwContext.Lecturer"
                          OnWorkRowClick="OpenKey"
                          OnActivityClick="OpenKey">

            <IdentityActions>
                @* ── The two role-specific controls, unchanged in behaviour ── *@

                @* Manual Moodle status (2026-05-17). Read-only for mentors;
                   inline-editable for Admin/Staff via the same dropdown and the
                   same PATCH it has always used. *@
                @if (CanManageMentors)
                {
                    <span class="lpw-moodle lpw-moodle-@MoodleSubmissionStatuses.Bucket(_moodleStatus)">
                        <span class="oi oi-book" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <span>מודל: @MoodleSubmissionStatuses.Label(_moodleStatus)</span>
                        <select class="lpw-moodle-select"
                                value="@(_moodleStatus ?? "")"
                                @onchange="OnMoodleStatusChanged"
                                disabled="@_moodleBusy"
                                title="עדכון סטטוס מודל">
                            <option value="">— לא נמדד —</option>
                            @foreach (var s in MoodleSubmissionStatuses.All)
                            {
                                <option value="@s">@MoodleSubmissionStatuses.Label(s)</option>
                            }
                        </select>
                    </span>
                }
                else if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_moodleStatus))
                {
                    <span class="lpw-moodle lpw-moodle-@MoodleSubmissionStatuses.Bucket(_moodleStatus)">
                        <span class="oi oi-book" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        מודל: @MoodleSubmissionStatuses.Label(_moodleStatus)
                    </span>
                }

                @if (CanManageMentors)
                {
                    <button type="button" class="lpw-add-mentor"
                            title="הוסף מנחה נוסף לפרויקט"
                            @onclick="OpenAddMentor">
                        <span class="oi oi-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        @(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_data.Header.MentorNames) ? "הוסף מנחה" : "הוסף מנחה נוסף")
                    </button>
                }
            </IdentityActions>
        </ProjectWorkspace>
    }
</div>


@*  ══ The two detail surfaces this workspace opens ═══════════════════════

    ONE SHELL, THE SAME ONE THE MENTOR'S WORKSPACE USES. A request used to
    grow inside the work list; a submission sent the reader to
    /lecturer/submissions and made them find the row again there. Both open
    PwDetail over this page now, with the identical hierarchy — eyebrow,
    title, status, who and when, then the content, the FILES, the trail, and
    the viewer's own action last.

    NO NEW BUSINESS LOGIC. The request is MentorRequestDetail with the same
    two POSTs and the same server-computed Viewer* flags; the submission is
    GET api/task-submissions/{id}/lecturer-detail with the same
    remind-mentor and lecturer-override-approve actions
    /lecturer/submissions has always used, behind the same [Admin,Staff]
    gate and the same "waiting three days or more" rule.
*@

@if (_openRequestId is int openReqId && RequestRow(openReqId) is { } openReq)
{
    <PwDetail IsOpen="true"
              Eyebrow="@RequestTypes.Label(openReq.RequestType)"
              Title="@openReq.Title"
              StatusText="@PwRequestVocabulary.StatusLabel(openReq.Status, ViewerOf(openReq))"
              StatusTone="@PwRequestVocabulary.Tone(openReq.Status, ViewerOf(openReq))"
              Meta="@RequestMeta(openReq)"
              OnClose="CloseRequest">
        <Side>
            <MentorRequestDetail RequestId="@openReqId"
                                 Layout="MentorRequestDetail.DetailLayout.Surface"
                                 Part="MentorRequestDetail.DetailPart.Action"
                                 ShowHeader="false"
                                 OnChanged="OnRequestChangedAsync" />
        </Side>

        <ChildContent>
            <MentorRequestDetail RequestId="@openReqId"
                                 Layout="MentorRequestDetail.DetailLayout.Surface"
                                 Part="MentorRequestDetail.DetailPart.Content"
                                 ShowHeader="false"
                                 OnChanged="OnRequestChangedAsync" />
        </ChildContent>
    </PwDetail>
}

@if (_openSubmissionId is not null)
{
    <PwDetail IsOpen="true"
              Loading="@_subLoading"
              LoadingLabel="טוענת פרטי הגשה…"
              Eyebrow="@_subDetail?.MilestoneTitle"
              Title="@(_subDetail?.TaskTitle ?? "הגשה")"
              StatusText="@SubStatusText"
              StatusTone="@SubStatusTone"
              Meta="@SubMeta"
              OnClose="CloseSubmission">

        <ChildContent>
        @if (_subDetail is null && !_subLoading)
        {
            <section class="pwd-sec">
                <p class="pwd-empty">לא הצלחנו לטעון את פרטי ההגשה. אפשר לסגור ולנסות שוב.</p>
            </section>
        }
        else if (_subDetail is { } sub)
        {
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(sub.Notes))
            {
                <section class="pwd-sec">
                    <p class="pwd-sec-title">הערות הסטודנט</p>
                    <p class="pwd-text pwd-quote">@sub.Notes</p>
                </section>
            }

            @*  THE DELIVERABLE. Drive-link submissions carry no uploaded
                file at all (submissions have been link-only since
                2026-05-19), so the link is a row of this list rather than
                something the reader has to know to look for. These are the
                SUBMISSION's files — not the project's shared materials in
                the header, and not a request's attachments. *@
            <section class="pwd-sec">
                <p class="pwd-sec-title">
                    קבצי ההגשה
                    @if (SubFileCount > 0)
                    {
                        <span class="pwd-count">@SubFileCount</span>
                    }
                </p>

                @if (SubFileCount == 0)
                {
                    <p class="pwd-empty">לא צורפו קבצים ולא נמסר קישור להגשה זו</p>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="pwd-files">
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(sub.DriveUrl))
                        {
                            <a class="pwd-file pwd-file-drive" href="@sub.DriveUrl"
                               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                                <span class="pwd-file-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <span class="oi oi-external-link"></span>
                                </span>
                                <span class="pwd-file-info">
                                    <span class="pwd-file-name">ההגשה ב-Google Drive</span>
                                    <span class="pwd-file-size">@HostOf(sub.DriveUrl)</span>
                                </span>
                            </a>
                        }
                        @foreach (var f in sub.Files.Where(f => !f.IsLecturerFeedback))
                        {
                            <div class="pwd-file">
                                <span class="pwd-file-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <span class="oi oi-file"></span>
                                </span>
                                <span class="pwd-file-info">
                                    <span class="pwd-file-name">@f.OriginalFileName</span>
                                    <span class="pwd-file-size">@FormatSize(f.SizeBytes)</span>
                                </span>
                                <a class="pwd-file-go"
                                   href="/submissions/@f.StoredFileName"
                                   download="@f.OriginalFileName"
                                   title="הורדה">
                                    <span class="oi oi-cloud-download" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </section>

            @* The mentor's own words — the reason a lecturer opens this at all. *@
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(sub.MentorFeedback))
            {
                <section class="pwd-sec">
                    <p class="pwd-sec-title">משוב המנחה</p>
                    <div class="pwd-fb pwd-fb-mentor">
                        <span class="pwd-fb-head">
                            <span class="oi oi-person" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            @(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(sub.MentorName) ? "מנחה" : sub.MentorName)
                            @if (sub.MentorReviewedAt.HasValue)
                            {
                                <span>· @sub.MentorReviewedAt.IsraelFormat("dd/MM/yy HH:mm")</span>
                            }
                        </span>
                        <p class="pwd-fb-text">@sub.MentorFeedback</p>
                    </div>
                </section>
            }

            @*  PREVIOUS ROUNDS, COLLAPSED. The round on screen is the one
                being read; the ones before it are reference, and the surface
                should not open on a trail. *@
            @if (PreviousRounds(sub) is { Count: > 0 } earlier)
            {
                <details class="pwd-more">
                    <summary>
                        סבבים קודמים
                        <span class="pwd-count">@earlier.Count</span>
                        <span class="oi oi-chevron-bottom pwd-more-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="pwd-more-body">
                        @foreach (var round in earlier)
                        {
                            <p class="pwd-line">
                                <span class="pwd-line-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                <span>
                                    הוגש @round.SubmittedAt.IsraelFormat("dd.MM.yyyy") ·
                                    @MentorStatusLabel(round.MentorStatus)
                                </span>
                            </p>
                        }
                    </div>
                </details>
            }

        }
        </ChildContent>

        <Side>
            @*  ── The lecturer's own move ───────────────────────────────
                Identical to /lecturer/submissions: a reminder to the
                mentor, or an override approval that REQUIRES a written
                reason. Drawn only when this submission is actually stuck
                on a mentor and has been for three days or more — the same
                gate that page applies, and the same one the endpoints
                enforce.

                In the ACTION column, so it stays on screen while the notes,
                the files and the rounds scroll beside it. *@
            @if (_subDetail is not null && SubCanRemind)
            {
                <section class="pwd-sec pwd-sec-action">
                    <p class="pwd-sec-title">פעולות המרצה</p>

                    @if (!SubCanOverride)
                    {
                        <p class="pwd-empty">
                            ההגשה עדיין בבדיקת המנחה. אישור חריג נפתח לאחר שלושה ימי המתנה.
                        </p>
                    }

                    <div class="pwd-form">
                        @if (SubCanOverride)
                        {
                            <label class="pwd-label" for="lpw-override-reason">
                                סיבת האישור החריג (חובה)
                            </label>
                            <input id="lpw-override-reason" class="pwd-input" type="text"
                                   maxlength="500"
                                   placeholder="למה ההגשה מאושרת בלי סקירת המנחה?"
                                   disabled="@_subBusy"
                                   @bind="_overrideReason"
                                   @bind:event="oninput" />
                        }

                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_subMessage))
                        {
                            <p class="pwd-empty">@_subMessage</p>
                        }
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_subError))
                        {
                            <p class="pwd-error" role="alert">@_subError</p>
                        }

                        <div class="pwd-actions">
                            <button type="button" class="pwd-btn pwd-btn-quiet"
                                    disabled="@_subBusy"
                                    @onclick="RemindMentorAsync">
                                תזכורת למנחה
                            </button>

                            @if (SubCanOverride)
                            {
                                <button type="button" class="pwd-btn pwd-btn-approve"
                                        disabled="@(_subBusy || string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_overrideReason))"
                                        @onclick="OverrideApproveAsync">
                                    @(_subBusy ? "שומרת…" : "אישור ההגשה")
                                </button>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
            }
        </Side>
    </PwDetail>
}

<!-- Add-mentor modal (lecturer/admin only) — unchanged -->
<AddMentorModal IsOpen="@_showAddMentor"
                ProjectId="@ProjectId"
                OnClose="CloseAddMentor"
                OnAdded="OnMentorAdded" />

@code {
    [Parameter] public int ProjectId { get; set; }
    [CascadingParameter] private User? _user { get; set; }

    // Section keys. They named TABS until this pass; all three sections are
    // on the page at once now, so nothing selects between them.
    private const string SecSubs  = "subs";
    private const string SecReqs  = "reqs";
    private const string SecTasks = "tasks";

    private ProjectOverviewDto?        _data;
    private ProjectRoadmapProgressDto? _roadmap;
    private List<PendingMentorApprovalRowDto> _approvals = new();

    private bool   _loading = true;
    private bool   _showAddMentor;

    /// <summary>The request whose detail surface is open, or null. It also
    /// marks the row it came from while the surface covers the page.</summary>
    private int?   _openRequestId;

    // ── The submission detail surface ───────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // Loaded on demand from the endpoint /lecturer/submissions already uses.
    // A mentor reading this same route never opens it: lecturer-detail,
    // remind-mentor and lecturer-override-approve are all [Admin,Staff], so
    // the row stays unclickable for them rather than offering a surface that
    // would 403.
    private int?  _openSubmissionId;
    private LecturerSubmissionDetailDto? _subDetail;
    private bool  _subLoading;
    private bool  _subBusy;
    private string _overrideReason = "";
    private string _subMessage = "";
    private string _subError   = "";

    // Manual Moodle-submission tracking. Loaded alongside the overview;
    // admins/staff flip the value via the inline dropdown.
    private string? _moodleStatus;
    private bool    _moodleBusy;

    /// <summary>Mentor-management actions are lecturer/admin only. Plain mentors
    /// view the same page (their own assigned project) but don't get the
    /// add-mentor button or the Moodle dropdown — server-side authorization is
    /// the actual gate; this just keeps the UI honest.</summary>
    private bool CanManageMentors => RoleService.IsAdminOrStaff(_user);

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync() => await ReloadAsync();

    private async Task ReloadAsync()
    {
        _loading = true;

        // Three independent round-trips, concurrently — the same shape the
        // mentor workspace loads with.
        var overviewTask = ProjectOverview.GetAsync(ProjectId);
        var roadmapTask  = RoadmapService.GetProjectProgressAsync(ProjectId);
        // pending-mentor-approvals is [Authorize(Admin, Staff)]; a mentor
        // reading this same route would only earn a 403 for it.
        var approvalTask = CanManageMentors
            ? Approvals.GetPendingAsync()
            : Task.FromResult<List<PendingMentorApprovalRowDto>?>(null);

        await Task.WhenAll(overviewTask, roadmapTask, approvalTask);

        _data    = await overviewTask;
        _roadmap = await roadmapTask;
        _approvals = (await approvalTask ?? new()).Where(a => a.ProjectId == ProjectId).ToList();

        // Best-effort: a Moodle failure shouldn't break the workspace, we just
        // don't show the chip.
        try
        {
            var moodle = await Http.GetFromJsonAsync<ProjectMoodleStatusDto>(
                $"api/projects/{ProjectId}/moodle-status");
            _moodleStatus = moodle?.Status;
        }
        catch { _moodleStatus = null; }

        _loading = false;
    }

    // ── The view ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    private ProjectWorkspaceView View
    {
        get
        {
            if (_data is null) return EmptyView;

            var stages = PwStages.Build(_roadmap, MilestonesLite);

            return new ProjectWorkspaceView(
                Identity:           Identity,
                Stages:             stages,
                StagesSummary:      PwStages.Summary(stages),
                StagesEmptyText:    "לא הוגדרו אבני דרך לפרויקט זה.",
                Sections:           Sections,
                Activity:           Activity);
        }
    }

    private static readonly ProjectWorkspaceView EmptyView = new(
        PwIdentity.Empty,
        Array.Empty<PwStage>(), "", "",
        Array.Empty<PwSection>(),
        Array.Empty<PwActivityRow>());

    private IReadOnlyList<PwMilestoneLite> MilestonesLite =>
        (_data?.Milestones ?? new())
            .Select(m => new PwMilestoneLite(
                m.ProjectMilestoneId, m.Title, m.OrderIndex, m.Status, m.DueDate))
            .ToList();

    // ── 1. Identity ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    private PwIdentity Identity
    {
        get
        {
            var h = _data!.Header;

            var meta = new List<PwMeta> { new(TypeLabel(h.ProjectType)) };
            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(h.MentorNames))
                meta.Add(new PwMeta(h.MentorNames!, "oi-person"));

            return new PwIdentity(
                Title:         h.ProjectTitle,
                TeamName:      string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(h.TeamName) ? $"צוות {h.ProjectNumber}" : h.TeamName,
                StageName:     StageName,
                // MILESTONE completion — the project's headline progress on both
                // workspaces. Task completion is on the משימות tab's note.
                ProgressPct:   _data.Summary.MilestoneProgressPercent,
                StatusText:    MentorProjectSignals.HealthLabel(Signal),
                StatusVariant: MentorProjectSignals.HealthVariant(Signal),
                Members:       _data.Header.TeamMembers
                                   .Select(m => string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(m.Email)
                                                ? m.FullName
                                                : $"{m.FullName} · {m.Email}")
                                   .ToList(),
                Meta:          meta,
                // The team's own ProjectResources, read-only — see PwMaterials.
                Materials:     PwMaterials.From(_data.Header.Resources));
        }
    }

    /// <summary>The project's single attention signal, read off the SAME three
    /// facts and through the SAME helper the mentor screens use — so the chip
    /// here and the row on a mentor's list can never disagree about one project.
    /// The server-scored HealthStatus column is deliberately not what drives it;
    /// nothing in the product currently maintains that column.</summary>
    private MentorProjectSignal Signal => MentorProjectSignals.Of(
        milestoneOverdue: _data!.Milestones.Any(m => m.IsOverdue),
        pendingReviews:   _approvals.Count,
        openRequests:     _data.Summary.OpenRequestCount);

    private string StageName =>
        _roadmap?.Stages.FirstOrDefault(s => s.Status == RoadmapStageStatuses.Current)?.Name
        ?? _data!.Milestones.FirstOrDefault(m => !PwStages.IsDone(m.Status))?.Title
        ?? "טרם החל";

    /// <summary>
    /// What this reader may do with ONE request, as the server answered it.
    ///
    /// <para>Per row, not per page: the capability depends on the request as
    /// much as on the reader. ProjectOverviewController fills these from
    /// ExtensionWorkflow.Resolve — the same function /extension/decision gates
    /// on — so this page cannot word a status as an action it would refuse. The
    /// mentor workspace builds the identical record from its own rows.</para>
    /// </summary>
    private PwRequestViewer ViewerOf(ProjectOverviewRequestDto r) => new(
        IsStaff:             CanManageMentors,
        CanRecommend:        r.ViewerCanRecommend,
        CanDecide:           r.ViewerCanDecide,
        MentorStageComplete: r.MentorStageComplete);

    // ── 3. The work ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    /// <summary>
    /// THE THREE SECTIONS, in the order the questions are asked, each carrying
    /// only what a lecturer can act on plus a little orientation.
    ///
    /// <para>Every row still exists and every one is still reachable; what
    /// changed is that a row now declares its <see cref="PwRowRank"/>, from the
    /// same predicate that already decided its label and its tone, and the
    /// section draws the ranks that need a person. The rest is behind the
    /// section's own "לכל…".</para>
    /// </summary>
    private IReadOnlyList<PwSection> Sections
    {
        get
        {
            var subs  = SubmissionRows;
            var reqs  = RequestRows;
            var tasks = TaskRows;

            int stuck    = _approvals.Count;
            int missing  = subs.Count(r => r.Rank == PwRowRank.Exception);
            int handedIn = _data!.Tasks.Count(t => t.IsSubmission && t.HasSubmission);
            int mine     = reqs.Count(r => r.Rank == PwRowRank.Waiting);
            int openReqs = reqs.Count(r => r.Rank != PwRowRank.Dormant);
            int overdue  = _data.Summary.OverdueTaskCount;

            return new[]
            {
                new PwSection(SecSubs, "הגשות", "oi-inbox",
                    Rows:        subs,
                    EmptyText:   "אין משימות הגשה בפרויקט זה",
                    // What the card says INSTEAD of rows when nothing is
                    // outstanding: the settled position, in one line.
                    Summary:     stuck > 0
                                     ? PwCount.Phrase(stuck, "הגשה אחת ממתינה לאישורך", "{0} הגשות ממתינות לאישורך")
                                     : missing > 0
                                         ? PwCount.Phrase(missing, "הגשה אחת חסרה", "{0} הגשות חסרות")
                                         : $"{handedIn} מתוך {subs.Count} הוגשו",
                    // "ממתינות לאישורך" is this reader's queue, not a
                    // failure — Attention. A MISSING submission is a genuine
                    // negative and keeps rose.
                    SummaryTone: stuck > 0 ? PwTone.Attention
                                 : missing > 0 ? PwTone.Late
                                 : PwTone.Quiet,
                    AllHref:     CanManageMentors ? "/lecturer/submissions" : null,
                    AllLabel:    CanManageMentors ? "להגשות ובקרה" : null,
                    MoreLabel:   "לכל ההגשות"),

                new PwSection(SecReqs, "בקשות", "oi-envelope-closed",
                    Rows:        reqs,
                    EmptyText:   "אין בקשות פתוחות בפרויקט זה",
                    Summary:     mine > 0
                                     ? PwCount.Phrase(mine, "בקשה אחת ממתינה לך", "{0} בקשות ממתינות לך")
                                     : openReqs > 0
                                         ? PwCount.Phrase(openReqs, "בקשה אחת פתוחה", "{0} בקשות פתוחות")
                                         : "אין בקשות פתוחות",
                    SummaryTone: mine > 0 ? PwTone.Attention : PwTone.Quiet,
                    AllHref:     "/management/requests",
                    AllLabel:    "לכל הבקשות",
                    MoreLabel:   "לכל בקשות הפרויקט"),

                new PwSection(SecTasks, "משימות", "oi-task",
                    Rows:        tasks,
                    EmptyText:   "אין משימות פתוחות בפרויקט זה",
                    Summary:     overdue > 0
                                     ? PwCount.Phrase(overdue, "משימה אחת באיחור", "{0} משימות באיחור")
                                     : PwCount.Phrase(tasks.Count, "משימה אחת פתוחה", "{0} משימות פתוחות"),
                    SummaryTone: overdue > 0 ? PwTone.Late : PwTone.Quiet,
                    MoreLabel:   "לכל המשימות",
                    // Task completion, displaced from the top of the page by
                    // milestone progress and kept where it means something.
                    Note:        $"{_data.Summary.TasksCompleted} מתוך {_data.Summary.TasksTotal} משימות הושלמו"),
            };
        }
    }

    /// <summary>
    /// Every deliverable on the project, ranked by whether anybody has to do
    /// something about it.
    ///
    /// <para>A row is marked "ממתין לאישורך" only when pending-mentor-approvals
    /// actually holds it, because that endpoint is the one that decides what a
    /// lecturer can act on. A deliverable that was never handed in and is past
    /// its date is the exception a lecturer intervenes on; one that has been
    /// handed in is context; one that is simply not due yet is dormant and is
    /// not drawn — it is the largest group on a healthy project and it says
    /// nothing.</para>
    ///
    /// <para>A row OPENS ITS SUBMISSION instead of sending the reader to
    /// /lecturer/submissions to find it again — for any round this page can
    /// name an id for. Only Admin/Staff: lecturer-detail is [Admin,Staff], so a
    /// mentor on this route keeps an unclickable row rather than a surface that
    /// would 403.</para>
    /// </summary>
    private IReadOnlyList<PwWorkRow> SubmissionRows
    {
        get
        {
            var stuck  = _approvals.ToDictionary(a => a.TaskId, a => a);
            var latest = _data!.RecentSubmissions
                              .GroupBy(s => s.TaskId)
                              .ToDictionary(g => g.Key, g => g.OrderByDescending(s => s.SubmittedAt).First());

            return _data.Tasks
                .Where(t => t.IsSubmission)
                .Select(t =>
                {
                    latest.TryGetValue(t.TaskId, out var sub);
                    bool isStuck = stuck.TryGetValue(t.TaskId, out var approval);

                    // The id this row can open. The stuck list is the more
                    // authoritative of the two — it is the round actually
                    // waiting — and RecentSubmissions is the fallback for a
                    // deliverable that has been handed in and reviewed.
                    int? submissionId = isStuck ? approval!.SubmissionId : sub?.SubmissionId;
                    bool canOpen = CanManageMentors && submissionId is not null;

                    // THE SEMANTIC VOCABULARY, and the same one בקשות and
                    // משימות use below. Every word is unchanged; only which
                    // role each state claims has moved:
                    //   ממתין לאישורך   Late -> Attention  it is not late, it
                    //                                      is waiting on YOU
                    //   נבדק ואושר      Teal -> Done
                    //   הוחזר לתיקון    Violet -> Waiting  it is with the team
                    //   הוגש            Blue -> Waiting    it is with the mentor
                    //   ...באיחור       Late               unchanged: really late
                    //   טרם הוגש        Quiet              unchanged
                    var (state, tone) =
                        isStuck                                 ? ("ממתין לאישורך", PwTone.Attention)
                        : sub?.LatestMentorStatus == "Approved" ? ("נבדק ואושר", PwTone.Done)
                        : sub?.LatestMentorStatus == "Returned" ? ("הוחזר לתיקון", PwTone.Waiting)
                        : t.HasSubmission                       ? ("הוגש", PwTone.Waiting)
                        : t.IsOverdue                           ? ("טרם הוגש · באיחור", PwTone.Late)
                        :                                         ("טרם הוגש", PwTone.Quiet);

                    var rank =
                        isStuck                          ? PwRowRank.Waiting
                        : !t.HasSubmission && t.IsOverdue ? PwRowRank.Exception
                        : t.HasSubmission                 ? PwRowRank.Context
                        :                                   PwRowRank.Dormant;

                    return new PwWorkRow(
                        Key:             submissionId is int id ? $"submission:{id}" : $"task:{t.TaskId}",
                        Title:           t.Title,
                        // The context line — which milestone this deliverable
                        // belongs to. The deadline still reaches the row only
                        // when it was missed.
                        Meta:            string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(t.MilestoneTitle) ? null : t.MilestoneTitle,
                        Trailing:        t.IsOverdue ? PwDates.DueLabel(t.DueDate) : null,
                        TrailingLate:    t.IsOverdue,
                        State:           state,
                        StateTone:       tone,
                        ActionLabel:     isStuck && canOpen ? "לטיפול" : null,
                        ActionIsPrimary: isStuck && canOpen,
                        IsClickable:     canOpen,
                        IsOpen:          submissionId is not null && _openSubmissionId == submissionId,
                        Rank:            rank);
                })
                .ToList();
        }
    }

    private IReadOnlyList<PwWorkRow> RequestRows =>
        _data!.OpenRequests
            .Select(r =>
            {
                // ONE ANSWER, FROM THE SERVER — see ViewerOf.
                var v = ViewerOf(r);

                return new PwWorkRow(
                Key:         $"request:{r.RequestId}",
                Title:       r.Title,
                // Who asked, on the context line; when they asked, at the end.
                Meta:        string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(r.CreatedByName) ? null : r.CreatedByName,
                Trailing:    r.CreatedAt.ToLocalTime().ToString("dd.MM"),
                // OWNERSHIP, NOT VISIBILITY. The label is second-person only
                // when the next move on this request is actually this
                // viewer's — resolved from the status plus their real
                // relationship to the project. Violet marks the same thing;
                // rose stays reserved for something genuinely late.
                State:       PwRequestVocabulary.StatusLabel(r.Status, v),
                StateTone:   PwRequestVocabulary.Tone(r.Status, v),
                ActionLabel: PwRequestVocabulary.ActionLabel(r.Status, v),
                ActionIsPrimary: PwRequestVocabulary.OwnedByViewer(r.Status, v),
                IsClickable: true,
                IsOpen:      _openRequestId == r.RequestId,
                Rank:        PwRequestVocabulary.OwnedByViewer(r.Status, v) ? PwRowRank.Waiting
                             : IsSettled(r.Status)                          ? PwRowRank.Dormant
                             :                                                PwRowRank.Context);
            })
            .ToList();

    /// <summary>A request nobody is waiting on any more. The two terminal
    /// statuses, named once.</summary>
    private static bool IsSettled(string status) =>
        status is RequestStatuses.Resolved or RequestStatuses.Closed;

    /// <summary>The open work. Submission tasks are excluded: they are the
    /// הגשות section, and listing them twice is what the old page's two tables
    /// did.
    ///
    /// <para>Late is the exception a supervisor scans for; work actually under
    /// way is context; a task nobody has started and which is not late requires
    /// nothing from anyone and is not drawn.</para></summary>
    private IReadOnlyList<PwWorkRow> TaskRows =>
        _data!.Tasks
            .Where(t => !t.IsSubmission
                        && t.Status is not ("Done" or "Completed"))
            .Select(t => new PwWorkRow(
                Key:          $"task:{t.TaskId}",
                Title:        t.Title,
                Meta:         string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(t.MilestoneTitle) ? null : t.MilestoneTitle,
                Trailing:     t.IsOverdue ? PwDates.DueLabel(t.DueDate) : null,
                TrailingLate: t.IsOverdue,
                State:        TaskStatusLabel(t),
                // In-progress is the team working — with somebody else, and
                // not a state this reader acts on. Waiting, the same rung
                // "הוגש" takes under הגשות.
                //
                // LATENESS IS NOT ON THE PILL HERE, and deliberately: this
                // label reads "בעבודה" / "פתוח" and never mentions being late,
                // so a rose pill on it was a colour contradicting its own word.
                // The row states it where it is true — Trailing renders the due
                // date rose (TrailingLate) and the section summary counts
                // "N משימות באיחור" in rose. Under הגשות the pill DOES read
                // "טרם הוגש · באיחור", and there it stays rose. Ordering is
                // untouched: Rank still reads t.IsOverdue.
                StateTone:    t.Status == "InProgress" ? PwTone.Waiting
                              : PwTone.Quiet,
                Rank:         t.IsOverdue                ? PwRowRank.Exception
                              : t.Status == "InProgress" ? PwRowRank.Context
                              : t.HasSubmission          ? PwRowRank.Context
                              :                            PwRowRank.Dormant))
            .ToList();

    // ── 4. פעילות אחרונה ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // "בקשה נפתחה — X" IS GONE. Every one of those lines named a request that
    // is a row in the בקשות section a few hundred pixels up the same page,
    // carrying its own status and its own filing date — the feed was reading
    // the page back to the reader.
    //
    // A submission ARRIVING stays, because it is the one thing here nothing
    // else on this page says: the הגשות section states a deliverable's state,
    // never who handed it in, when, or what the reviewer wrote about it. That
    // published feedback was already the only unique fact this block carried.
    //
    // Milestone completion and task creation are still not stored anywhere at
    // project scope, so they are absent rather than guessed — and when there
    // is nothing left to say, the block does not render at all.

    private IReadOnlyList<PwActivityRow> Activity =>
        _data!.RecentSubmissions
            .OrderByDescending(s => s.SubmittedAt)
            .Take(5)
            .Select(s => new PwActivityRow(
                Key:  $"submission:{s.SubmissionId}",
                Text: $"הגשה התקבלה — {s.TaskTitle}",
                // The reviewer's own words when they have been published — the
                // one fact the old submissions table carried that nothing else
                // on this page does.
                Meta: string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(s.LatestFeedback)
                          ? $"{s.SubmittedByName} · {s.SubmittedAt.ToLocalTime():dd.MM}"
                          : $"{s.SubmittedByName} · {Truncate(s.LatestFeedback!, 60)}",
                // An activity log reports what happened; it does not ask the
                // reader for anything, so it is quiet. It was Blue, which in
                // the Motiva scope resolves to violet — brand colour spent on
                // "an event exists".
                Tone: PwTone.Quiet,
                IsClickable: CanManageMentors))
            .ToList();

    // ── Opening a row ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // IN PLACE, BOTH KINDS. A request used to grow inside the list and a
    // submission used to navigate to /lecturer/submissions — a full trip to a
    // cross-project queue to read one project's item. Both open a detail
    // surface over this page now. Every destination they used to reach is
    // still reachable, from the section's own "all" link.

    /// <summary>The request id behind a row key.</summary>
    private static int? RowRequestId(string key) =>
        key.StartsWith("request:", StringComparison.Ordinal)
        && int.TryParse(key.AsSpan("request:".Length), out var id)
            ? id : null;

    /// <summary>The row behind the open request id. The surface's header is
    /// built from the SAME payload row the section drew, so the title, the type
    /// and the status on the surface cannot disagree with the row that opened
    /// it.</summary>
    private ProjectOverviewRequestDto? RequestRow(int id) =>
        _data?.OpenRequests.FirstOrDefault(r => r.RequestId == id);

    /// <summary>Who filed it and when — the two facts the title and the status
    /// do not carry.</summary>
    private static IReadOnlyList<PwMeta> RequestMeta(ProjectOverviewRequestDto r)
    {
        var meta = new List<PwMeta>();
        if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(r.CreatedByName))
            meta.Add(new PwMeta(r.CreatedByName, "oi-person"));
        meta.Add(new PwMeta($"נפתחה {r.CreatedAt.ToLocalTime():dd.MM.yyyy}", "oi-clock"));
        return meta;
    }

    private void CloseRequest() => _openRequestId = null;

    /// <summary>A decision was taken on the request surface — the request's
    /// status, the section summaries and the counts are all derived from the
    /// payload, so reload it and stay exactly where we are.</summary>
    private async Task OnRequestChangedAsync()
    {
        _openRequestId = null;
        await ReloadAsync();
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    private async Task OpenKey(string key)
    {
        var kind = key.Split(':')[0];

        switch (kind)
        {
            case "request":
                if (RowRequestId(key) is int reqId)
                    _openRequestId = _openRequestId == reqId ? null : reqId;
                break;

            case "submission":
                if (CanManageMentors
                    && int.TryParse(key.AsSpan("submission:".Length), out var subId))
                    await OpenSubmissionAsync(subId);
                break;

            // "task" — a row that names a deliverable with no submission yet,
            // or a plain task. Neither has a surface of its own, so it stays
            // put rather than opening something that cannot show it.
        }
    }

    // ── The submission surface ──────────────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // Same endpoint, same two actions and the same gates /lecturer/submissions
    // uses. Nothing about who may act, or when, is decided here: the detail
    // call, the reminder and the override are all [Admin,Staff] server-side,
    // and the three-day rule below mirrors the one that page applies to the
    // very same pending-mentor-approvals row.

    private async Task OpenSubmissionAsync(int submissionId)
    {
        _openSubmissionId = submissionId;
        _subDetail        = null;
        _subLoading       = true;
        _overrideReason   = "";
        _subMessage       = "";
        _subError         = "";
        StateHasChanged();

        _subDetail  = await SubmissionsService.GetLecturerDetailAsync(submissionId);
        _subLoading = false;
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    private void CloseSubmission()
    {
        _openSubmissionId = null;
        _subDetail        = null;
        _overrideReason   = "";
        _subMessage       = "";
        _subError         = "";
    }

    /// <summary>The pending-mentor-approvals row for the open submission, when
    /// there is one. Its presence is what makes this submission "stuck", and
    /// its DaysWaiting is what opens the override.</summary>
    private PendingMentorApprovalRowDto? OpenApproval =>
        _openSubmissionId is int id
            ? _approvals.FirstOrDefault(a => a.SubmissionId == id)
            : null;

    private bool SubCanRemind   => CanManageMentors && OpenApproval is not null;
    private bool SubCanOverride => OpenApproval is { DaysWaiting: >= 3 };

    /// <summary>THE DRIVE LINK COUNTS AS A FILE. Submissions have been
    /// Drive-link only since 2026-05-19, so counting uploaded files alone
    /// reports zero for every modern submission while the link to the
    /// deliverable sits in the same payload.</summary>
    private int SubFileCount =>
        (_subDetail?.Files.Count(f => !f.IsLecturerFeedback) ?? 0)
        + (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_subDetail?.DriveUrl) ? 0 : 1);

    private string? SubStatusText =>
        _subDetail is null            ? null
        : OpenApproval is not null    ? "ממתין לאישורך"
        :                               MentorStatusLabel(_subDetail.MentorStatus);

    /// <summary>The panel's badge takes the same five roles as the row it was
    /// opened from, so a submission does not change colour on the way in.</summary>
    private PwTone SubStatusTone =>
        OpenApproval is not null                  ? PwTone.Attention
        : _subDetail?.MentorStatus == "Approved"  ? PwTone.Done
        : _subDetail?.MentorStatus == "Returned"  ? PwTone.Waiting
        :                                           PwTone.Waiting;

    private IReadOnlyList<PwMeta> SubMeta
    {
        get
        {
            if (_subDetail is null) return Array.Empty<PwMeta>();

            var meta = new List<PwMeta>
            {
                new(_subDetail.SubmittedByName, "oi-person"),
                new(_subDetail.SubmittedAt.IsraelFormat(), "oi-clock"),
            };

            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_subDetail.MentorName))
                meta.Add(new PwMeta($"מנחה: {_subDetail.MentorName}"));

            return meta;
        }
    }

    private async Task RemindMentorAsync()
    {
        if (_openSubmissionId is not int id || _subBusy) return;

        _subBusy    = true;
        _subError   = "";
        _subMessage = "";
        StateHasChanged();

        var err = await Approvals.RemindMentorAsync(id);

        _subBusy = false;
        if (err is not null) _subError = err;
        else                 _subMessage = "נשלחה תזכורת למנחה.";
    }

    private async Task OverrideApproveAsync()
    {
        if (_openSubmissionId is not int id || _subBusy) return;

        // The server enforces the same requirement; this only avoids the
        // round-trip when we can already see the field is empty.
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_overrideReason))
        {
            _subError = "יש להזין את סיבת האישור החריג";
            return;
        }

        _subBusy    = true;
        _subError   = "";
        _subMessage = "";
        StateHasChanged();

        var err = await Approvals.OverrideApproveAsync(id, _overrideReason.Trim());

        _subBusy = false;

        if (err is not null)
        {
            _subError = err;
            StateHasChanged();
            return;
        }

        // The decision moves the item out of the approvals list, off the
        // section's summary and out of the header's signal — every one of those
        // is derived, so reload rather than patching rows by hand.
        CloseSubmission();
        await ReloadAsync();
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    // ── Moodle + add-mentor (unchanged flows) ───────────────────────────────

    private async Task OnMoodleStatusChanged(ChangeEventArgs e)
    {
        if (_moodleBusy) return;
        var raw = e.Value?.ToString() ?? "";
        string? next = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(raw) ? null : raw;

        _moodleBusy = true;
        try
        {
            var resp = await Http.PatchAsJsonAsync(
                $"api/projects/{ProjectId}/moodle-status",
                new SaveProjectMoodleStatusRequest { Status = next });

            if (resp.IsSuccessStatusCode) _moodleStatus = next;
            // Silent failure — the chip keeps its old value; admin retries.
        }
        catch { /* network issue — ignore, chip state unchanged */ }
        finally { _moodleBusy = false; }
    }

    private void OpenAddMentor()  => _showAddMentor = true;
    private void CloseAddMentor() => _showAddMentor = false;
    private async Task OnMentorAdded() => await ReloadAsync();

    // ── Display helpers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    private static string TypeLabel(string t) => t switch
    {
        "Technological"  => "טכנולוגי",
        "Methodological" => "מתודולוגי",
        _                => t,
    };

    private static string TaskStatusLabel(ProjectOverviewTaskDto t)
    {
        if (t.HasSubmission && !string.IsNullOrEmpty(t.Status) && t.Status != "Done" && t.Status != "Completed")
            return "הוגש לבדיקה";

        return t.Status switch
        {
            "Done" or "Completed" => "הושלם",
            "SubmittedToMentor"   => "הוגש לבדיקה",
            "InProgress"          => "בעבודה",
            "Open"                => "פתוח",
            "" or null            => "—",
            _                     => t.Status,
        };
    }

    private static string Truncate(string s, int max) =>
        s.Length <= max ? s : s[..max] + "…";

    /// <summary>The mentor's decision, in the same three words the mentor's own
    /// review surface uses for it.</summary>
    /// <summary>A URL's host, for a file row's second line — "drive.google.com"
    /// says where a link goes; the full URL just overflows the row.</summary>
    private static string HostOf(string? url) =>
        Uri.TryCreate(url, UriKind.Absolute, out var u) ? u.Host : "";

    /// <summary>Every round except the one on screen.</summary>
    private static IReadOnlyList<SubmissionHistoryItemDto> PreviousRounds(LecturerSubmissionDetailDto d) =>
        d.SubmissionHistory.Where(h => h.Id != d.Id).ToList();

    private static string MentorStatusLabel(string? status) => status switch
    {
        "Approved" => "אושר",
        "Returned" => "הוחזר לתיקון",
        _          => "בבדיקת מנחה",
    };

    private static string FormatSize(long bytes)
    {
        if (bytes < 1024)        return $"{bytes} B";
        if (bytes < 1024 * 1024) return $"{bytes / 1024.0:F1} KB";
        return $"{bytes / (1024.0 * 1024):F1} MB";
    }
}
